{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Astoria is a 2D Isometric game about surviving and exploring an alien planet. You're an intergalactic cargo shipping pilot and something has caused your ship to crash on a strange planet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240620/extras/Astoria_AboutThis_EscapePod.png?t=1741372112\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Locating any intact shipping containers and cargo is key to surviving on this alien planet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240620/extras/Astoria_AboutThis_Container.png?t=1741372112\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secure a reliable source of food by farming both alien crops and earth crops found from the cargo from the wreckage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240620/extras/Astoria_AboutThis_Farm.png?t=1741372112\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set up a base however and wherever you see fit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240620/extras/Astoria_AboutThis_Base.png?t=1741372112\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore various different zones and biomes and encounter alien creatures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240620/extras/Astoria_AboutThis_Biomes.png?t=1741372112\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover ancient mysteries and relics that might help along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240620/extras